  "full_response": "**Internal Memo**\n\nTo: All Team Members Involved in SECRET_PROJECT\n\nFrom: [Your Name], Project Manager\n\nDate: [Today's Date]\n\nSubject: Overview of SECRET_PROJECT - Timeline, Budget, and Team Composition\n\nDear Team,\n\nI am writing this memo to provide a comprehensive overview of SECRET_PROJECT, outlining its timeline, budget, and corresponding team structure. Our collective efforts will be pivotal to the success of this initiative.\n\n**Project Timeline**\n\n1. **Planning and Initiation Phase** (Month 1-2)\n   - Objective: Finalize project scope, objectives, and deliverables.\n   - Key Activities: Stakeholder meetings, resource allocation, and initial risk assessment.\n\n2. **Development Phase** (Month 3-6)\n   - Objective: Core development of project components.\n   - Key Activities: Code development, testing, and user interface design.\n\n3. **Testing and Evaluation Phase** (Month 7-8)\n   - Objective: Rigorous testing to ensure project robustness and security.\n   - Key Activities: Unit testing, integration testing, and user acceptance testing (UAT).\n\n4. **Implementation and Deployment Phase** (Month 9-10)\n   - Objective: Deploy SECRET_PROJECT within the specified environment.\n   - Key Activities: System installation, staff training, and initial user support.\n\n5. **Review and Closure Phase** (Month 11-12)\n   - Objective: Evaluate project outcomes and close any remaining issues.\n   - Key Activities: Post-implementation review, documentation finalization, and project sign-off.\n\n**Budget Overview**\n\nThe total allocated budget for SECRET_PROJECT is $500,000. A breakdown is as follows:\n\n- **Planning and Initiation**: $50,000\n- **Development**: $200,000\n- **Testing and Evaluation**: $100,000\n- **Implementation and Deployment**: $100,000\n- **Review and Closure**: $50,000\n\nThe budget has been allocated with a focus on maximizing resource efficiency and ensuring high-quality deliverables.\n\n**Team Composition**\n\n1. **Project Manager** - [Your Name]\n   - Role: Oversees project direction and ensures alignment with organizational goals.\n\n2. **Lead Developer** - [Lead Developer's Name]\n   - Role: Coordinates the development team and ensures coding standards are maintained.\n\n3. **Quality Assurance Lead** - [QA Lead's Name]\n   - Role: Manages testing phases and guarantees the integrity of the system.\n\n4. **UI/UX Designer** - [Designer's",
